(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze Browser Reflow \(Layout\) and Repaint, detailing Layout Thrashing and strategies to optimize DOM performance.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Understanding how DOM mutations interact with browser rendering engines is critical to) Tj
T*
(   preventing jank and stutter:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Reflow \(Layout\):) Tj
T*
(   The browser recalculates the physical geometric dimensions and coordinates \(x, y, width,) Tj
T*
(   height\) of elements in the render tree. Triggered by modifying width, height, padding, margin,) Tj
T*
(   font-size, adding/removing DOM nodes, or reading geometric properties.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Repaint:) Tj
T*
(   The browser redraws pixels on screen without altering geometry. Triggered by changing) Tj
T*
(   background-color, color, visibility, or box-shadow. Cheaper than reflow, but still CPU) Tj
T*
(   intensive.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Layout Thrashing \(Forced Synchronous Layout\):) Tj
T*
(   Occurs when code interleaves DOM writes and DOM reads in a loop:) Tj
T*
(   ```javascript) Tj
T*
(   // BAD: Forces browser to recalculate layout on every iteration!) Tj
T*
(   for \(let i = 0; i < elements.length; i++\) {) Tj
T*
(   const width = container.offsetWidth; // READ \(forces reflow\)) Tj
T*
(   elements[i].style.width = width + 'px'; // WRITE \(invalidates layout\)) Tj
T*
(   }) Tj
T*
(   ```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Optimization Strategies:) Tj
T*
(   - Batch Reads and Writes: Read all geometric values first, then apply all style mutations.) Tj
T*
(   - DocumentFragment: Assemble multiple child nodes off-DOM before attaching.) Tj
T*
(   - CSS Classes: Toggle classes rather than setting multiple inline styles.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
