T*
(   HTML5 provides a programmatic JavaScript API to validate form inputs against constraints before) Tj
T*
(   server transmission:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Core API Methods:) Tj
T*
(   1. `element.checkValidity\(\)`: Returns boolean indicating whether input satisfies all) Tj
T*
(   constraints.) Tj
T*
(   2. `element.reportValidity\(\)`: Evaluates validity and displays native browser error tooltip if) Tj
T*
