T*
(   - `valueMissing`: True if required field is empty.) Tj
T*
(   - `typeMismatch`: True if value does not match syntax \(e.g. invalid email or URL\).) Tj
T*
(   - `patternMismatch`: True if value violates regex pattern.) Tj
T*
