T*
(   open, removing background content from tab navigation.) Tj
T*
(   2. Initial Focus: Automatically set focus onto the modal container or its first interactive) Tj
T*
(   field upon opening \(`dialog.focus\(\)`\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Focus Trapping Loop:) Tj
T*
(   ```javascript) Tj
T*
(   modal.addEventListener\('keydown', function\(e\) {) Tj
T*
(   if \(e.key === 'Escape'\) closeModal\(\);) Tj
T*
(   if \(e.key !== 'Tab'\) return;) Tj
T*
