T*
(   1. Use `textContent` or `innerText` for plain text insertion; browsers treat input purely as) Tj
T*
(   strings, neutralizing tags.) Tj
T*
(   2. Create DOM nodes programmatically: `const h1 = document.createElement\('h1'\); h1.textContent) Tj
T*
(   = username;`.) Tj
T*
(   3. Use the Sanitizer API: `profileDiv.setHTML\(untrustedMarkup\)` cleanses malicious tags.) Tj
T*
(   4. Enforce strict Content Security Policy \(CSP\) headers.) Tj
